{"chapter_count":3,"chapters":[{"date":"2025-08-10","gallery_mode":"horizontal","id":81,"kind":"chapter","layout":{},"position":0,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":2000,"effect":"up"},"story":"The cliffs drop steeply to the Atlantic. Candelabra spurge stands between the rocks as if the heat belonged to it alone. We sit at the edge for a long time and watch the water.","title":"Above the sea"},{"date":"2025-08-13","gallery_mode":"horizontal","id":82,"kind":"chapter","layout":{},"position":1,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":2000,"effect":"up"},"story":"On the coast the surf meets black lava. Over the ridge the clouds pour into the valley like water. We stay until the light changes.","title":"Black rock, white spray"},{"date":"2025-08-17","gallery_mode":"horizontal","id":83,"kind":"chapter","layout":{},"position":2,"quote":"","reveal":{"duration":2000,"effect":"up"},"story":"Towards evening there is dust in the air, and the sun hangs red above dark mountains. Against the light people turn into silhouettes, and in a cave the rock frames the sky.","title":"Calima"}],"closing":"The heat passes. The light stays.","country":"Spain","cover":{"alt":"The sun in Calima haze above dark mountains","chapter_id":83,"credit":"","demo":true,"description":"","edits":{},"featured":true,"height":1467,"id":147,"large_url":"/WANDER/images/tf-calima-2200.webp","original_url":null,"position":5,"source_url":"","srcset":"/WANDER/images/tf-calima-640.webp 640w, /WANDER/images/tf-calima-1280.webp 1280w, /WANDER/images/tf-calima-2200.webp 2200w","taken_at":null,"title":"Calima sun","url":"/WANDER/images/tf-calima-1280.webp","width":2200},"cover_focus":null,"cover_id":147,"demo":true,"description":"A photo essay about heat, lava and the light at the end of the day.","end_date":"2025-08-19","filmstrip_ids":[142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149],"id":-2,"introduction":"In August Tenerife is hot and bright. We are out early and back late, and the longer the day lasts, the softer the light becomes.","is_exam